ion.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.title",defaultMessage:"Topical Relevance"},topicalRelevanceQuestion:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.question",defaultMessage:"Is the document about the same topic as the space?"},topicalRelevance3:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.3",defaultMessage:"Highly Relevant – Core part of this topic."},topicalRelevance2:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.2",defaultMessage:"Related – Shares the same theme but is tangential."},topicalRelevance1:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.1",defaultMessage:"Slightly Related – Only a small portion fits."},topicalRelevance0:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.topical-relevance.0",defaultMessage:"Irrelevant – No logical connection."},placementTitle:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.placement.title",defaultMessage:"Placement"},placementQuestion:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.placement.question",defaultMessage:"Is this the right folder suggestion for this content?"},placement2:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.placement.2",defaultMessage:"Perfect Fit – Exactly where it belongs."},placement1:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.placement.1",defaultMessage:"Acceptable – Not the best spot, but makes sense."},placement0:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.placement.0",defaultMessage:"Incorrect – Placement is confusing or wrong."},usefulnessTitle:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.usefulness.title",defaultMessage:"Usefulness"},usefulnessQuestion:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.usefulness.question",defaultMessage:"Would this doc actually help someone working in this space?"},usefulness4:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.usefulness.4",defaultMessage:"Essential – Crucial; the space is incomplete without it."},usefulness3:{id:"space-curation.suggestion-feedback-modal.usefulness.3",d